  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "the round begins",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "priority_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "1 if round - 2 * int(round / 2) == 1 else 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "taken",
            "value": "NONE"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "choice",
            "value": "NONE"
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Round {round}: seat {priority_seat} has priority."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "wager",
      "label": "the wager",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round == wager_round"
      },
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "Red",
          "Blue",
          "Green"
        ]
      },
      "store": "wager",
      "text": "Name your secret Wager colour: Red, Blue or Green. It cannot be changed and stays hidden until the end. At final scoring your expedition in this colour has its base doubled (negative too), and if it is empty it scores {empty_wager_score}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "row",
      "label": "the row is turned up",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(len(deck) - 1, int(uniform(0, len(deck))))]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "card_a_colour",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[e[1] for e in card_table if e[0] == pick][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "card_a_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[e[2] for e in card_table if e[0] == pick][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(len(deck) - 1, int(uniform(0, len(deck))))]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "card_b_colour",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[e[1] for e in card_table if e[0] == pick][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "card_b_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[e[2] for e in card_table if e[0] == pick][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Round {round} row: Card A is {card_a_colour} {card_a_value}; Card B is {card_b_colour} {card_b_value}."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "draft",
      "label": "priority pick",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == priority_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "A",
          "B",
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "store": "choice",
      "verify": {
        "bind": "p1pick"
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} (priority) chose {value}."
      },
      "text": "You have priority. Card A is {card_a_colour} {card_a_value}; Card B is {card_b_colour} {card_b_value}. Choose A, B or NONE. A card you take must be placed: if its value is higher than the top of your expedition in its colour it is added, otherwise it is buried and your Burial penalty rises by {burial_penalty}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "draft",
      "label": "priority placement",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "taken",
            "value": "$p1pick"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "place_colour",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card_a_colour if taken == 'A' else (card_b_colour if taken == 'B' else 'none')"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "place_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card_a_value if taken == 'A' else (card_b_value if taken == 'B' else 0)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "place_top",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[(p.red_top if place_colour == 'Red' else (p.blue_top if place_colour == 'Blue' else p.green_top)) for p in players if p.seat == priority_seat][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "fate_first",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'nothing taken' if taken == 'NONE' else ('added' if place_value > place_top else 'buried')"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == priority_seat"
            },
            "key": "burial",
            "value": {
              "calc": "burial_penalty"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fate_first == 'buried'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == priority_seat"
            },
            "key": "red_sum",
            "value": {
              "calc": "place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fate_first == 'added' and place_colour == 'Red'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == priority_seat"
            },
            "key": "red_top",
            "value": {
              "calc": "place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fate_first == 'added' and place_colour == 'Red'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == priority_seat"
            },
            "key": "blue_sum",
            "value": {
              "calc": "place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fate_first == 'added' and place_colour == 'Blue'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == priority_seat"
            },
            "key": "blue_top",
            "value": {
              "calc": "place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fate_first == 'added' and place_colour == 'Blue'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == priority_seat"
            },
            "key": "green_sum",
            "value": {
              "calc": "place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fate_first == 'added' and place_colour == 'Green'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == priority_seat"
            },
            "key": "green_top",
            "value": {
              "calc": "place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fate_first == 'added' and place_colour == 'Green'"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {priority_seat} chose {taken}: {fate_first}."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "draft",
      "label": "second pick",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat != priority_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "A",
          "B",
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "store": "choice",
      "verify": {
        "bind": "p2pick"
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} chose {value}."
      },
      "text": "Seat {priority_seat} had priority and chose {taken}. Card A is {card_a_colour} {card_a_value}; Card B is {card_b_colour} {card_b_value}. Choose A, B or NONE. Naming the card already taken counts as NONE and you receive nothing. A card you take must be placed: if its value is higher than the top of your expedition in its colour it is added, otherwise it is buried and your Burial penalty rises by {burial_penalty}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "draft",
      "label": "second placement",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "second_choice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'NONE' if $p2pick == taken else $p2pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != priority_seat"
            },
            "key": "choice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "second_choice"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "place_colour",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card_a_colour if second_choice == 'A' else (card_b_colour if second_choice == 'B' else 'none')"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "place_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card_a_value if second_choice == 'A' else (card_b_value if second_choice == 'B' else 0)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "place_top",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[(p.red_top if place_colour == 'Red' else (p.blue_top if place_colour == 'Blue' else p.green_top)) for p in players if p.seat != priority_seat][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "fate_second",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'nothing taken' if second_choice == 'NONE' else ('added' if place_value > place_top else 'buried')"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != priority_seat"
            },
            "key": "burial",
            "value": {
              "calc": "burial_penalty"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fate_second == 'buried'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != priority_seat"
            },
            "key": "red_sum",
            "value": {
              "calc": "place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fate_second == 'added' and place_colour == 'Red'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != priority_seat"
            },
            "key": "red_top",
            "value": {
              "calc": "place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fate_second == 'added' and place_colour == 'Red'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != priority_seat"
            },
            "key": "blue_sum",
            "value": {
              "calc": "place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fate_second == 'added' and place_colour == 'Blue'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != priority_seat"
            },
            "key": "blue_top",
            "value": {
              "calc": "place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fate_second == 'added' and place_colour == 'Blue'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != priority_seat"
            },
            "key": "green_sum",
            "value": {
              "calc": "place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fate_second == 'added' and place_colour == 'Green'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != priority_seat"
            },
            "key": "green_top",
            "value": {
              "calc": "place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "fate_second == 'added' and place_colour == 'Green'"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "The other player's pick counts as {second_choice}: {fate_second}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "report",
      "label": "the round report",
      "do": [],
      "text": "Round {round} summary. Priority seat {priority_seat} chose {taken} ({fate_first}); the other seat's pick counted as {second_choice} ({fate_second}). Cards nobody took are removed from the game. Seat 1: Red top {players[0].red_top} sum {players[0].red_sum}, Blue top {players[0].blue_top} sum {players[0].blue_sum}, Green top {players[0].green_top} sum {players[0].green_sum}, Burial {players[0].burial}. Seat 2: Red top {players[1].red_top} sum {players[1].red_sum}, Blue top {players[1].blue_top} sum {players[1].blue_sum}, Green top {players[1].green_top} sum {players[1].green_sum}, Burial {players[1].burial}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "final scoring",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round == rounds"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "((empty_wager_score if you.wager == 'Red' else empty_expedition_score) if you.red_sum == 0 else (you.red_sum - base_offset) * (wager_multiplier if you.wager == 'Red' else 1) + (bonus if you.red_sum >= bonus_threshold else 0)) + ((empty_wager_score if you.wager == 'Blue' else empty_expedition_score) if you.blue_sum == 0 else (you.blue_sum - base_offset) * (wager_multiplier if you.wager == 'Blue' else 1) + (bonus if you.blue_sum >= bonus_threshold else 0)) + ((empty_wager_score if you.wager == 'Green' else empty_expedition_score) if you.green_sum == 0 else (you.green_sum - base_offset) * (wager_multiplier if you.wager == 'Green' else 1) + (bonus if you.green_sum >= bonus_threshold else 0)) - you.burial"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "disclose": {
            "attribute": "wager",
            "of": 1,
            "to": "all",
            "text": "Seat {subject}'s Wager was {value}."
          }
        },
        {
          "disclose": {
            "attribute": "wager",
            "of": 2,
            "to": "all",
            "text": "Seat {subject}'s Wager was {value}."
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Final totals: seat 1 {players[0].score}, seat 2 {players[1].score}. The {cards_left_unrevealed} cards left in the deck are never revealed."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "after the last round",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.score",
      "reveal": [
        "wager"
      ],
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final scores: Seat 1 {players[0].score}, Seat 2 {players[1].score}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 12,
    "rounds_max": 12,
    "actions_max": 200,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "SETUP. The deck has {deck_size} cards: Red, Blue and Green, each with one card of every value from {min_card_value} to {max_card_value}. It is shuffled once, face down. Each player has three expeditions, one per colour. Each starts empty and is tracked by its top value (0 when empty) and its sum. Each player also has a Burial penalty starting at 0. All of these are public.\n\nEACH ROUND ({rounds} rounds). Priority belongs to seat 1 in odd rounds and to seat 2 in even rounds. This is announced. The top {row_size} cards of the deck are turned face up as Card A and Card B; their colours and values are shown to both players.\n\nWAGER, at the start of round {wager_round} only, before that round's cards are revealed: both players secretly and at the same moment name one colour: Red, Blue or Green. This is their Wager. The Wager cannot be changed and stays hidden until the end.\n\nThe priority player chooses A, B or NONE. If they chose a card, they receive it and place it. The other player is told what was chosen. They then choose A, B or NONE. Naming the card already taken counts as NONE and they receive nothing. If they chose a card, they receive it and place it. Choosing NONE changes nothing for that player.\n\nPlacement is mandatory. If the card's value is higher than the top value of that player's expedition in its colour (any card beats an empty expedition), it is added: its value is added to the sum, and it becomes the new top value. Otherwise the card is buried: it is removed from the game and that player's Burial penalty rises by {burial_penalty}.\n\nCards in the row that no one took are removed from the game. Both choices, where each card went, and all expedition states and Burial penalties are announced. After round {rounds}, the {cards_left_unrevealed} cards left in the deck are never revealed.\n\nFINAL SCORING, for each player and each colour. An empty expedition scores {empty_expedition_score}; however, if the empty expedition is in the player's Wager colour, it scores {empty_wager_score}. Otherwise, the base is the sum minus {base_offset}. If the colour is the player's Wager colour, the base is multiplied by {wager_multiplier}; negative bases are doubled too. Add {bonus} if the expedition's sum is {bonus_threshold} or more. A player's total is the sum of their three colour scores minus their Burial penalty. Wagers are revealed and the totals are compared: the higher total wins; equal totals are a draw (a shared win)."
}
